{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition","example","metric-case"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Sequential Compactness","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>列紧性 / Sequential Compactness</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h2>定义 / Definition</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 是拓扑空间（topological space）<span class=\"math inline\">X</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 称为<strong>列紧的</strong>（sequentially compact），如果对每个取值于 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 的序列（sequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(x_n)</span>，都存在子列（subsequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(x_{n_k})</span> 和点 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in A</span>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nx_{n_k}\\longrightarrow x.\n</div>\n<p>关键是：极限（limit）必须仍在 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 内，而不只是存在于环境空间 <span class=\"math inline\">X</span>。收敛的含义参见<a href=\"#/learn/top.convergence?anchor=definition\">拓扑空间中的收敛</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"example\"></a></p>\n<h2>一个容易混淆的例子 / Example</h2>\n<p>在通常拓扑的 <span class=\"math inline\">\\mathbb R</span> 中，<span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span> 列紧。<span class=\"math inline\">(0,1)</span> 不列紧：序列 <span class=\"math inline\">x_n=1/(n+1)</span> 的任何子列都趋于 <span class=\"math inline\">0</span>，而 <span class=\"math inline\">0\\notin(0,1)</span>。不过 <span class=\"math inline\">(0,1)</span> 的闭包为紧集 <span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span>，所以它是<a href=\"#/learn/top.relative-compactness?anchor=definition\">相对紧的</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"metric-case\"></a></p>\n<h2>何时与紧致等价 / Metric-space case</h2>\n<p>在度量空间（metric space）中，子集的列紧性与其<a href=\"#/learn/top.compactness?anchor=%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89\">紧致性</a>等价。对于一般拓扑空间，不能直接使用这一等价关系。<a href=\"https://www.ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-s190-introduction-to-metric-spaces-january-iap-2023/mit18_s190iap23_lec4.pdf\">MIT 度量空间课程第 4 讲，Theorem 4</a></p>\n<p>本节点从原紧性讲义的列紧段落整理；原有对照叙述保留在<a href=\"#/learn/top.compactness?anchor=%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89\">紧性与列紧性</a>。教材定位：Munkres，<em>Topology</em>，紧致性章节；来源登记见节点 metadata，不复制教材 PDF。</p>\n","id":"top.sequential-compactness.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"top.sequential-compactness","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"列紧性"}],"anchors":["definition","example","metric-case"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition","example","metric-case"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Sequential Compactness","external_links":[],"html":"<h1>列紧性 / Sequential Compactness</h1>\n<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<h2>定义 / Definition</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 是拓扑空间（topological space）<span class=\"math inline\">X</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 称为<strong>列紧的</strong>（sequentially compact），如果对每个取值于 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 的序列（sequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(x_n)</span>，都存在子列（subsequence）<span class=\"math inline\">(x_{n_k})</span> 和点 <span class=\"math inline\">x\\in A</span>，使</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\nx_{n_k}\\longrightarrow x.\n</div>\n<p>关键是：极限（limit）必须仍在 <span class=\"math inline\">A</span> 内，而不只是存在于环境空间 <span class=\"math inline\">X</span>。收敛的含义参见<a href=\"#/learn/top.convergence?anchor=definition\">拓扑空间中的收敛</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"example\"></a></p>\n<h2>一个容易混淆的例子 / Example</h2>\n<p>在通常拓扑的 <span class=\"math inline\">\\mathbb R</span> 中，<span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span> 列紧。<span class=\"math inline\">(0,1)</span> 不列紧：序列 <span class=\"math inline\">x_n=1/(n+1)</span> 的任何子列都趋于 <span class=\"math inline\">0</span>，而 <span class=\"math inline\">0\\notin(0,1)</span>。不过 <span class=\"math inline\">(0,1)</span> 的闭包为紧集 <span class=\"math inline\">[0,1]</span>，所以它是<a href=\"#/learn/top.relative-compactness?anchor=definition\">相对紧的</a>。</p>\n<p><a id=\"metric-case\"></a></p>\n<h2>何时与紧致等价 / Metric-space case</h2>\n<p>在度量空间（metric space）中，子集的列紧性与其<a href=\"#/learn/top.compactness?anchor=%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89\">紧致性</a>等价。对于一般拓扑空间，不能直接使用这一等价关系。<a href=\"https://www.ocw.mit.edu/courses/18-s190-introduction-to-metric-spaces-january-iap-2023/mit18_s190iap23_lec4.pdf\">MIT 度量空间课程第 4 讲，Theorem 4